{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/b5474d0c4b151b43b320768c51197ec8.poster.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/b5474d0c4b151b43b320768c51197ec8.webm?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/b5474d0c4b151b43b320768c51197ec8.mp4?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0<strong><i>Armored Of Doom</i></strong>, you can command dozens of modern tanks, each with unique performance\u00a0and tactical roles. The lightweight BMD-2M excels in mobility, perfect for rapid flanking and securing\u00a0keypositions. The PTZ-89 tank destroyer boasts devastating firepower, serving as the core force in\u00a0frontal assaults. The heavily armored T-72BM vanguard tank dominates team battles. Players can freely\u00a0assemble their lineup based on battle needs\u2014whether it\u2019s lightning-fast raids, holding strongholds,\u00a0or long-range suppression, you\u2019ll find the perfect steel partner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/03de2dad9a46ec0231ee75ded6489dc8.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=1412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/8897638226cd50af44ef681c536b39bb.poster.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/8897638226cd50af44ef681c536b39bb.webm?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/8897638226cd50af44ef681c536b39bb.mp4?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tank in the game is equipped with unique active and passive skills, adding layers of strategy\u00a0and exhilarating gameplay. Mastering skill combinations is key to seizing battlefield dominance.\u00a0Coordinate\u00a0with your team, and the thrill of combat will reach its peak!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/2ef8d3f9d83446147b50c34d6461726f.poster.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/2ef8d3f9d83446147b50c34d6461726f.webm?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/2ef8d3f9d83446147b50c34d6461726f.mp4?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Both CTF and MOBA modes feature an &quot;infinite respawn&quot; mechanic, ensuring fast-paced battles\u00a0where players return to the fray within seconds after defeat. Every match is a dynamic battle of wits,\u00a0letting players experience the true art of battlefield command!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/1365829c74ade2f67d4b0e4b5f320010.poster.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/1365829c74ade2f67d4b0e4b5f320010.webm?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/1365829c74ade2f67d4b0e4b5f320010.mp4?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/f423fc08a7a1aa62a73fa5e7bfedfa65.poster.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/f423fc08a7a1aa62a73fa5e7bfedfa65.webm?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/f423fc08a7a1aa62a73fa5e7bfedfa65.mp4?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with Unreal Engine, the game delivers stunning realism\u2014from metallic tank reflections to explosive\u00a0particle effects. Each tank model is based on real military data, with customizable skills and visible\u00a0details like barrel wear, tread marks, and impact sparks. Whether you\u2019re a graphics enthusiast or a\u00a0military hardware fan, this is the ultimate showcase of hardcore war aesthetics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/e24fbd91eb81e0d7d79517f125df8ff0.poster.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/e24fbd91eb81e0d7d79517f125df8ff0.webm?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/e24fbd91eb81e0d7d79517f125df8ff0.mp4?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow our development:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Discord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Telegram: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.Twitter: @ARMORED_OF_DOOM </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. VK: 872928465 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Thank you for your continued support! We value all commanders' feedback.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2902000?t=1755865938","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/0c08c4db1e7d2ea1b3a7b95aec8e23b7628cc480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755865938","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/cdd67334e1dd2e8d1fa1ee6c0ca64d2f9d390ffb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755865938","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/cdd67334e1dd2e8d1fa1ee6c0ca64d2f9d390ffb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755865938","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/b5474d0c4b151b43b320768c51197ec8.poster.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/b5474d0c4b151b43b320768c51197ec8.webm?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/b5474d0c4b151b43b320768c51197ec8.mp4?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0<strong><i>Armored Of Doom</i></strong>, you can command dozens of modern tanks, each with unique performance\u00a0and tactical roles. The lightweight BMD-2M excels in mobility, perfect for rapid flanking and securing\u00a0keypositions. The PTZ-89 tank destroyer boasts devastating firepower, serving as the core force in\u00a0frontal assaults. The heavily armored T-72BM vanguard tank dominates team battles. Players can freely\u00a0assemble their lineup based on battle needs\u2014whether it\u2019s lightning-fast raids, holding strongholds,\u00a0or long-range suppression, you\u2019ll find the perfect steel partner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/03de2dad9a46ec0231ee75ded6489dc8.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=1412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/8897638226cd50af44ef681c536b39bb.poster.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/8897638226cd50af44ef681c536b39bb.webm?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/8897638226cd50af44ef681c536b39bb.mp4?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tank in the game is equipped with unique active and passive skills, adding layers of strategy\u00a0and exhilarating gameplay. Mastering skill combinations is key to seizing battlefield dominance.\u00a0Coordinate\u00a0with your team, and the thrill of combat will reach its peak!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/2ef8d3f9d83446147b50c34d6461726f.poster.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/2ef8d3f9d83446147b50c34d6461726f.webm?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/2ef8d3f9d83446147b50c34d6461726f.mp4?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Both CTF and MOBA modes feature an &quot;infinite respawn&quot; mechanic, ensuring fast-paced battles\u00a0where players return to the fray within seconds after defeat. Every match is a dynamic battle of wits,\u00a0letting players experience the true art of battlefield command!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/1365829c74ade2f67d4b0e4b5f320010.poster.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/1365829c74ade2f67d4b0e4b5f320010.webm?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/1365829c74ade2f67d4b0e4b5f320010.mp4?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/f423fc08a7a1aa62a73fa5e7bfedfa65.poster.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/f423fc08a7a1aa62a73fa5e7bfedfa65.webm?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/f423fc08a7a1aa62a73fa5e7bfedfa65.mp4?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with Unreal Engine, the game delivers stunning realism\u2014from metallic tank reflections to explosive\u00a0particle effects. Each tank model is based on real military data, with customizable skills and visible\u00a0details like barrel wear, tread marks, and impact sparks. Whether you\u2019re a graphics enthusiast or a\u00a0military hardware fan, this is the ultimate showcase of hardcore war aesthetics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/e24fbd91eb81e0d7d79517f125df8ff0.poster.avif?t=1755865938\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/e24fbd91eb81e0d7d79517f125df8ff0.webm?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/extras/e24fbd91eb81e0d7d79517f125df8ff0.mp4?t=1755865938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow our development:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Discord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Telegram: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.Twitter: @ARMORED_OF_DOOM </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. VK: 872928465 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Thank you for your continued support! We value all commanders' feedback.</p>","developers":["Future Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902000/c60cf58dab9cfee1dac2619d55b8470127b0b53a/header.jpg?t=1755865938","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":